Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] Pump VSync while waiting for FLIP_PENDING

drawFrame spins until vsyncCallback clears FLIP_PENDING. On PS1 that is
an IRQ; on PSY-Z, VSyncCallbacks only run from VSync()/KernelVBlank. Pump
VSync(0) in the wait so the host does not deadlock before FILE_CACHE and
sound updates.

--- a/src/engine/gfx/display.c
+++ b/src/engine/gfx/display.c
@@ -72,6 +72,10 @@
     DrawSync(0);
     FLIP_PENDING = 1;
     while (*(volatile s32 *)&FLIP_PENDING != 0) {
+#if PORT_HOST
+        /* PSY-Z runs VSyncCallbacks from VSync()/KernelVBlank, not an IRQ. */
+        VSync(0);
+#endif
     }
     if (GFX.prim != NULL) {
         for (i = 0; i < LAYER_COUNT; i++) {
